# ── Secrets / local overrides — never commit ──────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.test
.env.production
**/application-local.yaml
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.properties
# Twilio is no longer used anywhere in this platform, so the previous
# `twilio_2FA_recovery_code.txt` entry has been removed. If that file still
# exists in your working copy, DELETE IT — it is no longer ignored, and a
# recovery code is a credential.
# Broad safety net for any local secret-bearing file of this shape:
*recovery_code*.txt
*_2FA_*.txt

